# Lₚ(s,χ)=1÷(1−χ(p)p⁻ˢ)

\[L_p(s,\chi)=\left(1-\chi(p)p^{-s}\right)^{-1}\]

Degree-one unramified Dirichlet Euler factor, explicitly in the existing Dirichlet IAS reading-notes comparison. An identity in a suitable convergence domain; not the analytic continuation by itself.

